  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Drawing**: Each turn, draw either the top card of the stock or the top discard. 2. **Melding**: If you can form valid melds meeting the initial point requirement, lay them face-up. 3. **Building**: After initial meld, add cards to any existing meld (yours or opponents'). 4. **Discarding**: End turn by discarding one card face-up.",
    Player: "1. **Drawing**: Each turn, draw either the top card of the stock or the top discard. 2. **Melding**: If you can form valid melds meeting the initial point requirement, lay them face-up. 3. **Building**: After initial meld, add cards to any existing meld (yours or opponents'). 4. **Discarding**: End turn by discarding one card face-up.",
    objective: "Be the first player to meld all 13 cards in your hand by forming sets and runs. The winner 'calls up' and scores zero; other players score penalty points for remaining cards.",
    gameplay: "1. **Drawing**: Each turn, draw either the top card of the stock or the top discard. 2. **Melding**: If you can form valid melds meeting the initial point requirement, lay them face-up. 3. **Building**: After initial meld, add cards to any existing meld (yours or opponents'). 4. **Discarding**: End turn by discarding one card face-up.",
    keyRules: [
      'Initial meld must total at least 40 or 51 points (house rule)',
      'Sets: 3-4 cards of same rank, all different suits (no duplicates)',
      'Runs: 3+ consecutive cards of same suit; Aces are high only (A-K-Q valid, 3-2-A invalid)',
      'Jokers are wild and can substitute any card in a meld',
      'Jokers in hand at end of play count as 15 penalty points',
      'Building: After initial meld, add cards to extend existing melds on table',
      'Cannot build more than 2 cards to same end of a run in one turn',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
