    exampleHands: [
      'Setup example: 13 card(s) per player.',
      "Rule example: Be the first player to meld all 13 cards in your hand by forming sets and runs. The winner 'calls up' and scores zero; other players score penalty points for remaining cards.",
      "Turn-flow example: 1. **Drawing**: Each turn, draw either the top card of the stock or the top discard. 2. **Melding**: If you can form valid melds meeting the initial point requirement, lay them face-up. 3. **Building**: After initial meld, add cards to any existing meld (yours or opponents'). 4. **Discarding**: End turn by discarding one card face-up.",
      'Scoring example: The winner of each hand scores zero penalty points. All other players add up the point value of cards remaining in their hands. Game continues until all but one player have been eliminated by exceeding 150 penalty points. The last surviving player wins the pool..',
